  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2105.08 Site Preparation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2105.08 Site Preparation. Prior to commencing a minor or major project, a qualified individual shall prepare the site so that the work can be executed in accordance with the approved work plan, if applicable, and all other requirements of this chapter.\n\nSource. #7647, eff 2-16-02 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 2100) (formerly Env-Wm 3905.08); ss by #9645, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12605, eff 9-1-18",
